I am walking through the streets of Berlin.
Today it is very cold.
The wind is blowing hard.
I am wearing my green winter coat.
But I am still cold anyway.
My hands are freezing.
I need a break.
I would like to warm up.
I am looking for a cozy place.
I look to the left and to the right.
Up ahead is a street corner.
I see a small café on the corner.
The café looks very inviting.
Light is shining through the window.
It is definitely warm in there.
I walk quickly across the street.
I stand in front of the café.
I decide on this café.
I would like to drink a hot coffee.
